from the Telegram Desktop repository, which draws them from Apple's "Apple Color
Emoji" font. They are not covered by the GPL above and the Rustgram authors do
not license them; see crates/tg-emoji/LICENSE-EMOJI. To switch back to the
Apache-2.0 Noto Emoji set, revert commit 5d8fb9c1.

Rustgram is an unofficial client. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by
Telegram. It uses its own name and icon, and each build needs its own
api_id / api_hash from https://my.telegram.org.

